<p><strong>Hydro Extrusion is 81% of every permitted ton of NOx in Spanish Fork</strong>, and nothing else is close.<a class="fnref" href="#fd0"><sup>43</sup></a> <a class="fnref" id="rs51" href="#fs51"><sup>35</sup></a></p>
