<tr><td><strong>Truck traffic</strong></td><td>6,400 to 12,800 diesel truck trip ends a month, that is 3,200 to 6,400 truck visits, at full 24/7 occupancy by a large distribution tenant <a class="fnref" id="rs88" href="#fs88"><sup>41</sup></a><a class="fnref" id="rs89" href="#fs89"><sup>42</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fd0"><sup>43</sup></a></td><td>None regularly. The facility has no loading or distribution operations. The honest figure is a few hundred local employee vehicle trips per day, all passenger cars <a class="fnref" href="#fs60"><sup>51</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fd0"><sup>43</sup></a></td></tr>
