<tr><td><strong>Technology</strong></td><td>Bloom Energy Server 6.5 solid-oxide fuel cells, natural gas, 325 kW per unit ? 1,210 units, 393.25 MW combined nameplate, per the state air permit. <em>250 MW is the rack-level compute load</em> <a class="fnref" href="#fs1"><sup>1</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fs3"><sup>3</sup></a><a class="fnref" href="#fs60"><sup>51</sup></a></td></tr>
