<p>Utah County Assessor, parcel <strong>67:228:0003</strong>, Tax Area 150.<a class="fnref" href="#fs12"><sup>10</sup></a> <strong>The combined certified rate for tax year 2026 is 0.009563</strong>:<a class="fnref" href="#fs18"><sup>15</sup></a></p>
