<p><strong>One commitment worth pinning down, from the 23 JUL marketing video:</strong> <em>"A share of every site's revenue flows straight back into the community that hosts it."</em> A revenue-share is materially stronger than a flat "&gt;$500,000," because a percentage scales with the facility and a flat figure does not. <strong>Ask which form the development agreement takes.</strong></p>
  <h3 id="the-tax-base-is-a-community-benefit-not-a-city-line-">The tax base is a community benefit, not a city line item</h3>
