<p><strong>That changes which depreciation curve governs, and it runs in the proposal's favor.</strong> Utah Admin Code <strong>R884-24P-33</strong> sets percent-good schedules by class, and two classes behave completely differently:<a class="fnref" id="rs17" href="#fs17"><sup>14</sup></a></p>
